2 NOTE Marion, could you please use a citation for this document? It would help provide to context. Is this a death notice? The script  appears to be an "L" in the first name, similar to the "L" in the last name. It's curious how this me
3 CONC dia appears which seems to replace the Lange Coat of Arms, that I had recently placed. What is the protocol? Discussions are in progress... Also, I find it highly curious your interest here (Marion Lisbeth Jensen is Christen Miche
3 CONC lsen Lange's grandson's wife's third great nephew's ex-partner's niece.) Why the interest in my family?
