1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lise Elmquist
2 CONT Født: 12-9-1919 i Svendborg
2 CONT Død: 19-6-2013 (93 år)
2 CONT Gravsted: Manglende oplysning
2 CONT
2 CONT Biografi
2 CONT Lise Elmquist, skuespillerinde, der var datter af landsretssagfører, fhv. justitsminister Aage Ludvig Holberg Elmquist (18-05-1888 - 20-09-1962) og Anna Elisabeth Mende (02-09-1897 - 16-02-1926), var elev ved Odense Teater 1941-42
2 CONC  og spillede Marianne i "Jul i Købmandsgården". Senere var hun på turné hos Svend Wedel. Lise Elmquist blev den 1. juni 1940 gift på Svendborg Rådhus med journalist Carl Aage Corneliussen (f. 23-07-1916). Ægteskabet blev opløst de
2 CONC n 15. november 1944. Siden blev hun den 22. juni 1948 gift i Sionskirken i København med tandlæge Christian Poul Ellegaard-Hansen (f. 12-03-1915). Også dette ægteskab blev opløst.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: https://danskefilm.dk/skuespiller.php?id=12729
2 CONT
2 CONT Translation:
2 CONT
2 CONT Lise Elmquist
2 CONT Born: 12-9-1919 in Svendborg
2 CONT Died: 19-6-2013 (93 years old)
2 CONT Gravesite: Missing information
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT Lise Elmquist, actress, daughter of High Court prosecutor, former Minister of Justice Aage Ludvig Holberg Elmquist (18-05-1888 - 20-09-1962) and Anna Elisabeth Mende (02-09-1897 - 16-02-1926), was a student at Odense Theatre 1941-
2 CONC 42 and played Marianne in "Jul i Købmandsgården". Later she was on tour with Svend Wedel . Lise Elmquist was married on 1 June 1940 at Svendborg Town Hall to journalist Carl Aage Corneliussen (b. 23-07-1916). The marriage was diss
2 CONC olved on 15 November 1944. Later on 22 June 1948 she was married in the Zion Church in Copenhagen to dentist Christian Poul Ellegaard-Hansen (b. 12-03-1915). This marriage was also dissolved.
