1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Their joint Last Will and Testament was deemed invalid due to the fact that an insufficient value of tax stamps had been affixed to it, and also as it purported to be a joint will but remained unsigned by the wife.
2 CONC  It must be noted that the will was drawn up in the concentration camp when the couple most probably did not have the financial means to buy stamps of the required value. However, these issues were inconsequential as he died penni
2 CONC less, having lost his entire estate during the Anglo Boer War.
