2 CONT * Dansk biografisk lexikon, volume 14, 1900
2 CONT * Henriksen, Petter, ed. (2007). "Ræder". Store norske leksikon (in Norwegian). Oslo: Kunnskapsforlaget. Retrieved 28 October 2010.
2 CONT * P. B. G. (1926). "Ræder". In Blangstrup, Christian. Salmonsens Konversations Leksikon (in Danish) 21 (2nd ed.). Copenhagen: J. H. Schultz. p. 655. Retrieved 14 November 2010.
2 CONT * "Johan Christopher Ræder" (in Norwegian). Norwegian Social Science Data Services (NSD). Retrieved 14 November 2010.
