1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.sa.dk/ao-soegesider/da/billedviser?epid=17119863#158935,26709864
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Hans Christian Pedersen Lange''' was born on January 2, 1755 in Vandkunsten 8, København, Vor Frue sogn Sokkelund Herred, Københavns Amt, Danmark. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34638637338 Peder Christensen Lan
2 CONC ge] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34715059773 Marthe Ølgod]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans married [https://www.geni.com/profile-127306049 Sophia Dorothe Christiana Nielsen]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1789 [https://www.geni.com/profile-127306821 Martha Henriette Lange];
2 CONT * 1791 [https://www.geni.com/profile-127307160 Peter Nicolaj Hansen Lange];
2 CONT * 1792 [https://www.geni.com/profile-127307563 Frederik Carl Hansen Lange];
2 CONT * 1793 [https://www.geni.com/profile-127307804 Christian Peter Hansen Lange];
2 CONT * 1795 [https://www.geni.com/profile-127308085 Marcus Jonas Ludvig Lange];
2 CONT * 1796 [https://www.geni.com/profile-127308189 Maria Christine Lange];
2 CONT * 1797 [https://www.geni.com/profile-127308330 Frederik Erik August Lange]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on October 4, 1821 in Vingårdsstræde matr 138, København, Sokkelund Herred, Københavns Amt, Sjælland, Danmark and was buried on October 9, 1821. 
2 CONT ----
