1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mourits Trap Friis was born on 5 Jan 1737 in Astrup. He was christened on 6 Feb 1737 in Astrup Kirke. He died on 7 Oct 1808 in Marslev. He was buried on 14 Oct 1808 in Marslev, Bjerge. He was married on 25 Aug 1766
2 CONC  in Flødstrup. Mourits was employed as Cand.theol., Sognepræst til Marslev. 
