2 CONT * "South Africa, Cape Province, Probate Records of the Master of the High Court, 1834-1989," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:QGBB-CGB2 
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Master's Office, Cape Town, 31st May 1837
2 CONT * EDICT
2 CONT * The Next of Kin and Creditors of Petrus Cornelis VERMEULEN, late of
2 CONT * Winterveld in the District of Coleberg, deceased, are required to take
2 CONT * notice that the said Petrus Cornelis VERMEULEN died intestate, and that a
2 CONT * Meeting of the Next of Kin and Creditors of the Deceased, and surviving
2 CONT * Widow Hendrina Johanna MARAIS, and all others whom these presents may
2 CONT * concern, will be held before the Resident Magistrate, at his Office,
2 CONT * Colesberg, on Tuesday the 11th July next, at 10 o'clock in the forenoon
2 CONT * precisely; and all such persons as aforesaid are hereby required to attend
2 CONT * at the place and time aforesaid; then and there to see some Person or
2 CONT * Persons selected by such Magistrate, for approval by the Master of the
2 CONT * Supreme Court, as fit and proper to be by the said Master appointed Executor
2 CONT * or Executors Dative to the Estate of such deceased person as aforesaid, and
2 CONT * Tutor or Tutors Dative of the minor Heirs of the Deceased.
2 CONT * Clerke Burton, Master of the Supreme Court
