1 NOTE {geni:about_me} At the time of her Marriage, Francina was Aged 21 years and from the Farm ' Slangrivier' Vrede District of the Orange Free State. Her Husband George Frederik de Villiers was Aged 23 years and a Tax Offical ( Belast
2 CONC inggaade ) from Parys, South African Republic ( Transvaal )
2 CONT
2 CONT They were Married at the NG Kerk, Vrede on 28 June 1898 by Presiding Minister, Ds J.H. Enslin
