1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Martha Henriette Lange''' was born on December 19, 1789 in Vandkunsten 8, København, Københavns Amt, Sokkelund Herred, Danmark. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-127306470 Hans Christian Pedersen Lange] and [https:
2 CONC //www.geni.com/profile-127306049 Sophia Dorothe Christiana Nielsen]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Henriette married [https://www.geni.com/profile-123788762 Christian Albrecht Cold] on June 24, 1819 in København, Holmens, Sokkelund, Københavns amt. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1820 [https://www.geni.com/profile-116277970 Christian Magdalus Cold];
2 CONT * 1822 [https://www.geni.com/profile-127308965 Elisa Sophie Cold];
2 CONT * 1824 [https://www.geni.com/profile-119612526 Carl Albrecht Cold]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on January 20, 1877 in Skindergade 32, Trinitatis Sogn, København, Københavns Amt, Sokkelund Herred, Danmark from Alderdom and was buried on January 26, 1877 in Assistens Kirkegård, København, Denmark. 
