2 PLAC Magnus & Co. and Bø Teglverk AS
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 3 JUL 1872
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bergen
3 STAE Hordaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1 MAY 1935
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bergen
3 STAE Hordaland
