1 NAME Albert Kvetmong Købke /Gottlieb/
2 GIVN Albert Kvetmong Købke
2 SURN Gottlieb
2 _MARNM Gottlieb
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 22 JAN 1864
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Hong Kong
1 DEAT
2 DATE 21 MAY 1930
2 ADDR
