2 CONT [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QSQ-G944-XQX5?i=155&cc=2078555&personaUrl=%2Fark%3A%2F61903%2F1%3A1%3AQG88-JDTQ Dåb fra Familysearch].
