1 NAME Nicoline Christiane /Fabricius/
2 GIVN Nicoline Christiane
2 SURN Fabricius
2 _MARNM Fabricius
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE BET 28 MAR 1803 AND 28 JUL 1803
2 ADDR
3 CITY København
1 DEAT
2 DATE 25 AUG 1890
2 ADDR
3 CITY København
1 BURI
2 DATE 27 AUG 1890
2 PLAC Assistens Kirkegaard
2 ADDR
