1 OCCU resid. kapellan ved Københavns Vor Frue Kirke
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Nicoline Christiane Fabricius''' was born between March 28, 1803 and July 28, 1803 in København. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34683272161 Niels Foss Fabricius] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-7631244 Christi
2 CONC ane Margrethe Kiølner]. She was a resid. kapellan ved Københavns Vor Frue Kirke. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicoline Christiane married [https://www.geni.com/profile-109162434 Hans Ditlev Fabricius] on October 30, 1824 in Kbh., Vor Frue Kirke. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1827 [https://www.geni.com/profile-7824110 Anna Gunilda Fabricius];
2 CONT * 1831 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34677277684 Niels Foss Fabricius];
2 CONT * 1833 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34677276098 Hans Ditlev Fabricius, twin];
2 CONT * 1833 [https://www.geni.com/profile-63850007 Christiane (Fabricius) Bjerre, twin];
2 CONT * 1836 [https://www.geni.com/profile-109162358 Johanne Marie (Fabricius) de Neergaard]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on August 25, 1890 in København and was buried on August 27, 1890 in Assistens Kirkegaard. 
2 CONT ----
