1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Politiets Registerblade:  https://kbharkiv.dk/brug-samlingerne/soeg-i-indtastede-kilder/post/17-1515793:  https://kbharkiv.dk/permalink/post/17-1515793.
2 CONT
2 CONT *
2 CONT
2 CONT *Politiets Registerblade: https://kbharkiv.dk/brug-samlingerne/soeg-i-indtastede-kilder/post/1-335311:
2 CONT *https://kbharkiv.dk/permalink/post/1-335311:
2 CONT * Dødsaarsag: Apoplexia (Apopleksi), Kronisk nyre- og hjertelidelse.
2 CONT
2 CONT *
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto was an engineer and went to the Kings military college. He went on to be a transportation engineer and was primarily instrumental in building the first train line out of Copenhagen. We think this might be the line to Roskilde
2 CONC . We have in the family the solid silver urn given to him for his meritorious service for this train line. We think he may have been best man at the princes wedding and the prince was at his. Otto's father Carl Christian Carlsen w
2 CONC as a Krisgard which is a high ranking member of the Kings close war council. Carl was also a military engineer and we suspect his father was in the kings military also as there is proof that Carl grew up in the Kings chambers in C
2 CONC hristianborg Castle in Copenhagen. 
2 CONT
2 CONT *
