2 CONT Met Dagmar in in Coppenhagan ? Dagmar had two sisters that took Leonard and Karen when Olaf put them in orphanage. When Karen McKeny was a freshman in Carnegie - 1956? - Dagmar had just died. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage to Dagmar: They got married 8. Nov 1898 in Helligånds parish, Copenhagen, Denmark. The comment states that the wedding was in accordance to law of 4. Apr 1855 (which means they could choose another priest or perhaps churc
2 CONC h than the one belonging to the parish where they lived)..Olaf Leonhart Carlsen is now a fully trained painter "malermester" (might have his own company) and lives at Vesterbrogade 89. He marries Dagmar Haraldine Concordia Dahl bo
2 CONC rn 24 Sep 1872 in Brøndbyvester; her father is shoemaker Carl August Dahl and her mother is Christiane Amalie born Mikkelsen. 
