1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Inger Mimi Elisabeth, born 9 October 1861 at Rendsborg, died 27 August 1894 at Copenhagen, married 24 March 1891 at Copenhagen to Karl Arvid Vikström (born 17 February 1850 at Stockholm, Sweden).
2 CONT
2 CONT Ligesom søstrene Alvilda Harbou (g. Hoff)) og Dagmar Harbou (g. Hjort) gik Inger Harbou på N. Zahles skole og ligesom søsteren Dagmar begyndte hun at undervise på Frederiksberg Latin- og Realskole. 
2 CONT
2 CONT I en periode af 80'erne gav hun gratis privatundervisning for at forberede unge kvinder til almindelig forberedelseseksamen. I det hele taget synes Inger at have været besjælet af samme tanker, som hendes mor og hendes søstre.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hun blev gift med Arvid Vikström og flyttede til Sverige. Ægteskabet var ikke lykkeligt. Hun døde tidligt af tuberkulose. http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=:2611341&id=I286
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Johannes Vilhelm Antonius HARBOU * b: 17 JAN 1810 in Generalmajor à la suite, kmd. af Db. c: 01 JUN 1810 in Christiansborg slotskirke.  Mother: Louise Ulrikke Mariane HELLESEN b: 08 APR 1833
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.3.2.6. Johannes Wilhelm Anthonius Harbou, born 17 January 1810 at Copenhagen, christened 1 June at Christiansborg castle church, died 14 April 1891 at Copenhagen, married 8 July 1852 at Copenhagen to Louise Ulrikke Mariane Helle
2 CONC sen (born 8 April 1833 at Kallundborg).
2 CONT
2 CONT * 2.3.2.6.1. Frederik Hans Walter Harbou, born 17 April 1853 at Altona, married 1stly 18 May 1887 at Frederiksberg to Sofie Cathrine Vilhelmine Marie Dahlerup (born 6 October 1854 at Frederiksberg, died 20 October 1890 at Frederik
2 CONC sberg); married 2ndly 16 February 1892 at Copenhagen to Ludovica Gandil (born 30 December 1857 at Copenhagen).
2 CONT * 2.3.2.6.1.1. *by 1* Johannes Vilhelm Harbou, born 4 March 1888 at Frederiksberg.
2 CONT * 2.3.2.6.1.2. *by 1* Knud Harbou, born 11 July 1889 at Frederkisberg.
2 CONT * 2.3.2.6.1.3. *by 1* a daughter, born 19 September 1890 at Frederiksberg, died 20 September 1890 at Frederkisberg.
2 CONT * 2.3.2.6.1.4. *by 2* Sofie Elisabeth, born 16 May 1893 at Frederiksberg.
2 CONT * 2.3.2.6.1.5. *by 2* a stillborn daughter 5 October 1894 at Frederiksberg.
2 CONT * 2.3.2.6.1.6. *by 2* Niels Harbou, born 27 January 1896 at Frederiksberg.
2 CONT * 2.3.2.6.2. Helga Charlotte, born 12 October 1855 at Altona, married 6 May 1885 at Copenhagen to Gordon Norrie (born 6 May 1855 at Helsingør).
2 CONT * 2.3.2.6.3. Knud Harbou, born 12 January 1858 at Altona, died 5 April 1858 at Altona.
2 CONT * 2.3.2.6.4. Ane Marie Louise Dagmar, born 13 January 1860 at Rendsborg, married 11 November 1887 at Copenhagen to Niels Hjort (born 8 June 1862 at Glücksborg).
2 CONT * 2.3.2.6.5. Inger Mimi Elisabeth, born 9 October 1861 at Rendsborg, died 27 August 1894 at Copenhagen, married 24 March 1891 at Copenhagen to Karl Arvid Vikström (born 17 February 1850 at Stockholm, Sweden).
2 CONT * 2.3.2.6.6. Vilhelmine Ulrikke Alvilda, born 16 December 1862 at Rendsborg .
2 CONT
