1 NAME Cornelia /Moldrup/
2 GIVN Cornelia
2 SURN Moldrup
2 _MARNM Moldrup
2 NICK Cornelia Bekkers Molderup
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 15 NOV 1702
2 ADDR
3 CITY Vestervig
3 STAE Thisted amt
3 CTRY Denmark
1 BAPM
2 DATE 23 NOV 1702
2 ADDR
3 CITY Vestervig
1 DEAT
2 DATE 29 APR 1727
2 ADDR
3 CITY Randers
3 STAE Randers amt
3 CTRY Denmark
1 BURI
2 DATE 6 MAY 1727
2 ADDR
3 CITY Randers, Skt. Morten
3 STAE Randers amt
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Stammoder til den ældre gren af slægten Rothe i Danmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT Vedr. navn: Opkaldt efter Cornelia Bichers g.m. Joachim Irgens, den tidligere ejer af Vestervig Kloster. Cornelia Bichers er datter af borgmester i Amsterdam Dr. Andries Bicker (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andries_Bicker) og Cath
2 CONC arina Tengnagel. Man finder dog ikke navnet "Bichers" ved hendes dåb, kun "Cornelia", eller ved hendes bryllup "jomfru Cornelia Mollerup". Slægten forandrede efternavnet fra Mollerup til Moldrup og på stikket angives hendes navn s
2 CONC om "Cornelia Rothe født Moldrup". Aht. konsistens bør efternavnet "Moldrup" foretrækkes for efterkommere af Peder Nielsen Mollerup.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Patriciske Slægter, Vol 1, p.258, gives her name as "Cornelia Bekkers Molderup". It is debatable whether "Bichers", "Bicker" or "Bekkers" should be mentioned at all. She was named after Cornelia Bichers married to the previous own
2 CONC er of Vestervig Kloster Joachim Irgens. She was the daughter of the mayor and regent of Amsterdam Andries Bicker. "Bichers/Bekkers" is not mentioned at her christening "Cornelia" or at her marriage "jomfru Cornelia Mollerup". One 
2 CONC print names her "Cornelia Rothe born Moldrup". Peder Nielsen (her father) took the name Mollerup after the village where he was born and was always signing letters etc. as "Peder Nielsen Mollerup". After 1731 all his descendants h
2 CONC ave used the name "Moldrup". For the sake of consistency "Moldrup" is preferable.
